    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9811" root="حين" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَائِنَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A deadly,</i> or <i>destructive, calamity that
befalls one:</i> (K, TA:) <i>a calamity in which is</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَيْن</span>: (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوَائِنُ</span>. (K.) [In the CK it
is, in one place, erroneously substituted for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَانِيَّةٌ</span>,
as meaning “ wine. ”]

